WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:12.957 --> 00:00:14.692
&gt;&gt; Laura: I HAVE A LITTLE RING

00:00:14.124 --> 00:00:17.928
THAT THEY GAVE ME LAST NIGHT.

00:00:14.825 --> 00:00:18.362
IT IS THE MONDAY BEFORE

00:00:18.062 --> 00:00:21.899
ASH WEDNESDAY.

00:00:18.496 --> 00:00:24.668
IT WAS UNBELIEVABLE.

00:00:22.032 --> 00:00:28.806
50TH ANNIVERSARY RENDEZVOUS,

00:00:24.802 --> 00:00:30.007
WATCHING MORE THAN 30 FLOATS AND

00:00:28.939 --> 00:00:30.574
MARCHING BANDS COMING INTO THE

00:00:30.140 --> 00:00:30.975
CONVENTION CENTER AT

00:00:30.708 --> 00:00:33.511
NEW ORLEANS.

00:00:31.108 --> 00:00:34.178
IT WAS UNBELIEVABLE, ONE OF THE

00:00:33.644 --> 00:00:37.281
SERIAL EXPERIENCES THAT YOU

00:00:34.311 --> 00:00:42.019
REALLY HAVE TO SEE.

00:00:37.414 --> 00:00:42.953
HE FOUND ANOTHER CREW DEDICATED

00:00:42.152 --> 00:00:45.189
TO HONORING OUR VETERANS AND

00:00:43.087 --> 00:00:49.593
TRANSFORMING THEIR LIVES.

00:00:45.322 --> 00:00:50.427
WATCH.

00:00:49.727 --> 00:00:52.596
♪ ♪

00:00:50.561 --> 00:00:53.464
&gt;&gt; IN NEW ORLEANS, ALONG THE

00:00:52.730 --> 00:00:56.567
MISSISSIPPI, A PREPARADE A PARTY

00:00:53.597 --> 00:00:57.868
IS UNDERWAY.

00:00:56.700 --> 00:01:02.106
THESE ARE MEMBERS OF A

00:01:02.239 --> 00:01:06.043
THE HOST PARADES AND UNDERTAKE

00:01:05.476 --> 00:01:08.979
PHILANTHROPIC WORKS THROUGHOUT

00:01:06.176 --> 00:01:10.014
THE YEAR.

00:01:09.113 --> 00:01:13.384
THEY WERE FOUNDED UP BY A GROUP

00:01:10.147 --> 00:01:14.485
OF LAWYERS FROM NEW ORLEANS.

00:01:13.517 --> 00:01:17.121
HE WAS ONE OF THEM.

00:01:14.618 --> 00:01:21.792
&gt;&gt; A FEW OF US HAVE RETURNED

00:01:17.254 --> 00:01:23.327
FROM ACTIVE DUTY OF SERVING, AND

00:01:21.926 --> 00:01:24.295
THERE WERE NO CRUISE AROUND THAT

00:01:23.460 --> 00:01:24.795
WOULD ACTUALLY HONOR JUST A

00:01:24.428 --> 00:01:27.431
MILITARY.

00:01:24.929 --> 00:01:29.600
AND WITH SO MANY PEOPLE SERVING

00:01:27.565 --> 00:01:30.568
OVERSEAS, WE WANTED TO HAVE FUN,

00:01:29.733 --> 00:01:33.470
BUT WE WANTED TO DO SOMETHING

00:01:30.701 --> 00:01:35.239
THAT WOULD HONOR THE MILITARY.

00:01:33.604 --> 00:01:36.674
A FALLEN SOLDIER, WOUNDED

00:01:35.372 --> 00:01:40.511
WARRIORS, SO MANY THINGS.

00:01:36.807 --> 00:01:41.412
&gt;&gt; THE ORGANIZATION ROLLING

00:01:40.644 --> 00:01:46.650
THROUGH THE USE OF STREETS.

00:01:41.545 --> 00:01:48.852
THIS ONLY ONE, DEDICATED IT TO

00:01:46.784 --> 00:01:49.219
CELEBRATING AND POPULATED BY

00:01:48.986 --> 00:01:51.088
VETERANS.

00:01:49.353 --> 00:01:51.589
&gt;&gt; AS HE CAN SEE, RAIN OR SHINE,

00:01:51.221 --> 00:01:54.692
THEY ARE ROLLING.

00:01:51.722 --> 00:01:55.559
A LITTLE RAN COULD NOT STOP THIS

00:01:54.825 --> 00:01:57.227
CREW.

00:01:55.693 --> 00:02:00.564
MANY OF THE WRITERS HAVE SEEN

00:01:57.361 --> 00:02:01.966
COMBAT IN IRAQ, AFGHANISTAN, AND

00:02:00.698 --> 00:02:03.767
VIETNAM.

00:02:02.099 --> 00:02:05.603
FOR SOME, IT IS NOT JUST A

00:02:03.901 --> 00:02:09.974
PARADE, BUT AN EXPERIENCE OF JOY

00:02:05.736 --> 00:02:11.208
AND HEALING.

00:02:10.107 --> 00:02:14.178
FRED AND BILL SERVED IN VIETNAM

00:02:11.342 --> 00:02:18.015
TOGETHER, BUT IT WAS THE LEGION

00:02:14.311 --> 00:02:22.586
OF MOBS THAT REUNITED THEM AND

00:02:18.148 --> 00:02:24.188
TO CHANGE THEM THE BETTER.

00:02:22.720 --> 00:02:29.593
&gt;&gt; EVERYONE KNOWS HOW WE WERE

00:02:24.321 --> 00:02:30.494
TREATED AND ALL OF THAT STUFF,

00:02:29.727 --> 00:02:34.732
PTSD, SO MY WIFE'S THOUGHTS THAT

00:02:30.628 --> 00:02:36.400
IT WOULD BE A GOOD IDEA FOR ME,

00:02:34.865 --> 00:02:39.370
PERSONALLY, TO JOIN A GROUP THAT

00:02:36.533 --> 00:02:40.170
WAS CATERING TO VETS.

00:02:39.503 --> 00:02:41.138
AND IT HAS.

00:02:40.304 --> 00:02:43.374
IT HAS BEEN A BLESSING.

00:02:41.271 --> 00:02:46.577
IT HAS KIND OF BROUGHT ME OUT OF

00:02:43.507 --> 00:02:47.578
MY SHELL, GAVE ME AN OPPORTUNITY

00:02:46.710 --> 00:02:48.912
TO MEET FOLKS.

00:02:47.711 --> 00:02:50.748
AND I FEEL A LOT MORE

00:02:49.046 --> 00:02:53.584
COMFORTABLE BEING AROUND

00:02:50.881 --> 00:02:54.952
VETERANS.

00:02:53.717 --> 00:02:57.154
AND ACTIVE MILITARY, SO WE NOT

00:02:55.085 --> 00:02:58.956
ONLY GET TO INTERACT WITH PEOPLE

00:02:57.554 --> 00:03:00.057
WHO HAD SERVED YEARS AGO LIKE

00:02:59.089 --> 00:03:03.027
US, BUT WE ALSO GET TO INTERACT

00:03:00.190 --> 00:03:03.761
WITH THE NEW PEOPLE, AND THE

00:03:03.160 --> 00:03:08.666
PEOPLE WHO ARE SERVING OUR

00:03:03.894 --> 00:03:09.767
COUNTRY TODAY.

00:03:08.799 --> 00:03:11.101
&gt;&gt; EVERY BRANCH OF THE MILITARY

00:03:09.900 --> 00:03:15.906
IS HONORED.

00:03:11.235 --> 00:03:18.776
AND BEFORE THE PARADE, SENSUAL

00:03:16.040 --> 00:03:21.545
MENTION                 SPECIAL

00:03:18.909 --> 00:03:24.848
MENTION IS MADE.

00:03:21.679 --> 00:03:25.749
&gt;&gt; WE ARE VERY APPRECIATIVE OF

00:03:24.982 --> 00:03:28.285
THE PEOPLE WHO SPONSORED US.

00:03:25.883 --> 00:03:31.355
THEY REALLY WENT OUT OF THEIR

00:03:28.419 --> 00:03:32.022
WAY TO DO THIS FOR US.

00:03:31.488 --> 00:03:34.258
AND WE REALLY APPRECIATED

00:03:32.156 --> 00:03:35.693
BECAUSE SO MANY PEOPLE FORGOT

00:03:34.391 --> 00:03:38.629
THEY VIETNAM VETERANS.

00:03:35.826 --> 00:03:39.930
&gt;&gt; BORN AND RAISED IN A

00:03:38.762 --> 00:03:41.065
NEW ORLEANS, THIS IS THE FIRST

00:03:40.064 --> 00:03:46.136
TIME THAT I HAVE EVER RIDDEN IN

00:03:41.198 --> 00:03:47.805
THE PARADE.

00:03:46.270 --> 00:03:48.739
&gt;&gt; IT'S AMAZING HOW MUCH SUPPORT

00:03:47.938 --> 00:03:50.908
WE GET FROM THE GENERAL PUBLIC.

00:03:48.872 --> 00:03:52.743
PEOPLE REALLY APPRECIATE THE

00:03:51.041 --> 00:03:53.477
MILITARY, AND THAT'S WHY IT IS

00:03:52.876 --> 00:03:57.848
SO IMPORTANT FOR OUR MEMBERS TO

00:03:53.610 --> 00:04:00.584
SEE THAT.

00:03:57.981 --> 00:04:03.787
IT IS FANTASTIC.

00:04:00.718 --> 00:04:10.327
&gt;&gt; OF ALL OF THE CRUISE, THE

00:04:03.921 --> 00:04:12.129
LEGION OF MARS MAKES IT UNIQUE.

00:04:10.461 --> 00:04:16.834
THIS CREW GETS SOMETHING BACK

00:04:12.262 --> 00:04:20.838
FROM PARADE GOERS, THE RESPECT

00:04:16.967 --> 00:04:22.873
AND GRATITUDE THAT THEY DESERVE.

00:04:20.971 --> 00:04:24.174
FOX NEWS, REPORTING FROM

00:04:23.006 --> 00:04:25.142
NEW ORLEANS.

00:04:24.308 --> 00:04:25.876
&gt;&gt; Laura: THAT'S FANTASTIC.

00:04:25.275 --> 00:04:32.583
THE FOUNDERS TELL US THAT THEY

00:04:26.009 --> 00:04:35.452
NAMED THE CREW K-R-E-A W AFTER

